OL,3,GNEWSAGreen travel scheme challenged by
OL,4,Acouncillors
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rarely used council process has been
OL,7,Ftriggered to force a local authority to
OL,8,Freconsider approving plans for a green
OL,9,Ftravel scheme which are unpopular with
OL,10,Fresidents.
OL,12,FMiddlesbrough councillors have
OL,13,Ftriggered the "call in" process after a
OL,14,Ftravel scheme was given the green light
OL,15,Fdespite nearly two thirds of resident
OL,16,Frespondents responding negatively to
OL,17,Fit.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
