OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGreen travel scheme challenged by
OL,4,Acouncillors
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf it goes ahead there will be
OL,7,F"improved pedestrian facilities" as
OL,8,Fwell as a continuous cycling route from
OL,9,FMandale roundabout over to Marton Road,
OL,10,Fnear the James Cook University
OL,11,FHospital.
OL,13,FFive independent councillors signed the
OL,14,Fproposal to allow councillors to vote
OL,15,Fon Friday to send the decision back to
OL,16,Fthe executive for reconsideration.
